# Stormworks' drain pit (CIPlay stormworks_spikes, 11-12 w08; in a test world 'CI ...', under CIGapsWatchHealth). Points as
# in its recipe: the pit flattened from 46 -17 to 51 -17 (floor 5 m), stakes at 46.5 / 48.5 / 50.5 -17 (zones swspike1-3,
# r 1.5, damage 4), the warning sign at 44 -17.5, planks along both rims (z -14.9 and -19.1). In the pit the stakes cost
# health; along the planks they cost none.
island Stormworks keep
offset 1.3157 -1.5104
hour 11
weather Calm
where Block_Floor_Wood
where VP_SpikeTrap

picture sw_pit 43 8.5 -17 49 5.5 -17
at 48.5 -17 h=6
wait 3
expect message Stakes in the silt
expect hurt 4
at 43.5 -14.9
expect unhurt
walk 43.5 -14.9 to 46.25 -14.9 to 50.75 -14.9 to 52.5 -14.9
expect unhurt
walk 52.5 -19.1 to 50.75 -19.1 to 46.25 -19.1 to 43.5 -19.1
expect unhurt
